@H1 2. CALIBRATION AND PURPOSE (phase 0-1)
@H2 2.1 Purpose statement
@BLOCK PURPOSE
Deliver a buildable, repairable, extensible city design in which ALL physical networks and the productive landscape form one synergetic system, adaptable to any site by editing a configuration file, and meeting the {{d.gates_n}} binary gates below.
@END
@H2 2.2 Success criteria = binary gates (python -m efe_city check)
{{table:gates}}
@H2 2.3 Rigor calibration
@P Task magnitude MACRO; deployment scale GLOBAL/INFRASTRUCTURE; rigor ULTRA: all nine phases, five-method plateau verification, adversarial stress, theoretical-limit analysis. Dimension weights follow purpose-relevance and set iteration priority only; they never lower the certification bar.
@H2 2.4 KPI definitions and weights
{{table:weights}}
@H2 2.5 Constraint inventory (5-tier; assumed conventions challenged)
{{table:constraints}}
@H2 2.6 Interpretation log
@BLOCK ASSUMPTIONS A-01..A-08
A-01 'application' = the application layer (digital services via AequChain/AequApp) AND application of surfaces and materials.
A-02 'value unto earth' = (a) load path to ground (foundations) and (b) net-positive return to the land: recharge, soil carbon, habitat, nutrient return (7.6).
A-03 'ECT' = all further related items; handled by the interaction engine (6.8).
A-04 'github.come/aequchain-dev' read as github.com/aequchain-dev; not accessible this session (O-09).
A-05 'longevity sa.md' = ingredient demand list; cultivation capacity only.
A-06 Reference site = Cape Town region (user context + SA resources); every value is a parameter.
A-07 'public water' = drinking points, hygiene hubs, reclaimed-water network, shared water commons.
A-08 tornado / typhoon / hurricane: hazard profiles + hardened shelters, not worst-case design of every building.
@END
@H1 3. REQUIREMENTS AND TRACEABILITY (phase 1)
@P Every clause of the brief became a shall-statement with a verification route. All 45 are designed; those citing a gate or test are model-verified; field items are listed in 13.7.
{{table:requirements}}
